          ],
          "narration": "You've watched twenty-four-billion-parameter models crawl on your machine. This one writes faster than you can read. Follow a single token as it gets written."
        },
        {
          "id": "s2",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 12.1,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
            "num:24.0B"
          ],
          "narration": "Picture it mid-answer, about to write the next word. Before anything moves, the whole model is already loaded. The model card lists twenty-four billion parameters, the learned numbers a model stores, all sitting in memory."
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 10.7,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
            "glossary:expert",
            "glossary:token"
          ],
          "narration": "The token moves. A token is a chunk of text about a word long. It enters a mixture of experts, a block of specialists that wakes only a few per word."
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 9.3,
          "specific": false,
          "hits": [],
          "narration": "Picture a specialist clinic: a triage nurse pages the handful each visit needs. That nurse is the router, a small scorer, and she re-picks for every word."
        },
        {
          "id": "s5",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 15.5,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
            "num:2.45B"
          ],
          "narration": "What fires is two point four five billion parameters, the active count on the model card. The rest of the roster stays dark. The clinic pays every specialist whether or not they are paged, so the memory bill never shrinks. Their shift is mostly waiting."
        },
        {
          "id": "s6",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 14.8,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
