            "entity:Apple M5 Max"
          ],
          "narration": "So your token exits at small-model speed. Liquid measured one hundred eighty-four tokens a second on Apple's newest laptop chip, in llama.cpp. The reframe: memory pays for the total, speed pays for the active. A big model is not automatically a slow one."
        },
        {
          "id": "s7",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 8.6,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
