            "entity:Qwen3.6-35B-A3B"
          ],
          "narration": "The catch shows up in Liquid's own table. The model beats the bigger Qwen on most of Liquid's agent benchmarks, tests that grade tool use."
        },
        {
          "id": "s8",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 8.3,
          "specific": true,
          "hits": [
            "entity:Liquid"
          ],
          "narration": "It loses the knowledge-heavy ones; Liquid suggests pairing it with web search. No independent benchmark exists yet, so quality is Liquid's word for now."
        },
        {
          "id": "s9",
          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 12.4,
          "specific": false,
          "hits": [],
          "narration": "Running it today is one file download. One llama.cpp command starts it, and LM Studio works too. Ollama's tag still pulls the smaller model in that family. The file fits in a laptop-sized slice of memory."
        },
        {
          "id": "s10",
          "role": "payoff_close",
          "est_duration_s": 10.3,
